{"4098920":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"BRICK 2 - Rags 2 Riches","steam_appid":4098920,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Core Features<\/h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/780c6ac351c398035bedb79ff7d2b89b.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/780c6ac351c398035bedb79ff7d2b89b.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/780c6ac351c398035bedb79ff7d2b89b.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is big and it is not empty. Downtown towers and traffic lights, quiet suburbs, highways out into the forest, a lake in the trees, snow on the high ground and dust on the flats. Day turns to night, storms roll in, and the cold is something you dress for.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride the bus, hail a taxi, take the train around the city, or take a car that is not yours.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GATHER. CRAFT. BUILD.<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b5ba6d76f9558837929fae00128f9847.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b5ba6d76f9558837929fae00128f9847.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b5ba6d76f9558837929fae00128f9847.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees, break rocks, mine ore, scavenge dumpsters. Smelt at a furnace, cook on a campfire, and work your way up three tiers of workbench.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then build: a foundation, walls, a door with a code on it, a second floor. Claim the ground with a tool cabinet, keep the upkeep paid, upgrade wood to stone to metal, wire up a generator, and hang your own paintings on the walls. A base is a home until somebody brings C4.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNT AND SURVIVE<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/5731ce98849a7db82d8698c801f79844.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/5731ce98849a7db82d8698c801f79844.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/5731ce98849a7db82d8698c801f79844.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health, stamina, hunger and thirst all count. Hunt deer with a crossbow, fish the lakes, grow your own crops, and dress for the weather, because the highlands will kill you in the wrong clothes. Get sick, get hurt, get patched up.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CITY NEVER SLEEPS<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/98de83dc981a4d448a2cfe6f58992fbd.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/98de83dc981a4d448a2cfe6f58992fbd.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/98de83dc981a4d448a2cfe6f58992fbd.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brick City runs without you: traffic, pedestrians, buses on their routes, the train on its loop. Hustle on a street corner, sell to the pawn shops, buy a car at Big Tony's, put a song on your phone. Your contacts text you with jobs. Some of them are even legal.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE WHAT YOU WANT<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b44fa46acfdc7be24b5f5054ae0b315d.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b44fa46acfdc7be24b5f5054ae0b315d.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b44fa46acfdc7be24b5f5054ae0b315d.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rob Summit Bank: blow the door, crack the vault, and get to the car before the stars stack up. The police come in waves, SWAT follows, and the helicopter does not give up until it is on fire.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/da56bd9905280b1563555b76bd0046df.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/da56bd9905280b1563555b76bd0046df.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/da56bd9905280b1563555b76bd0046df.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four gangs hold turf you can take. The military airbase has soldiers and the best gear on the island. The prison has its own problems. Bullets drop and take time to arrive, so line up the shot.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN A CREW<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b2b42bdf2a27deb28470edb7c2adceb9.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b2b42bdf2a27deb28470edb7c2adceb9.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/b2b42bdf2a27deb28470edb7c2adceb9.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a crew with your friends, or hire recruits at a Clubhouse, arm them, and leave them guarding the base. Fill the crew treasury, take turf, and raid the people who raided you. Other players are the most dangerous thing on the island. So are you.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ON THE ROADMAP<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Early Access. These are the plans for what comes next (not things in the build today), and the order is decided by what players ask for:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something to spend a fortune on.<\/strong> Property and businesses to own<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More of the city.<\/strong> More places to go into, more jobs, more to steal<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Server tools<\/strong> for people who run their own servers: wipes, rules and admin controls<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop<\/strong>, so modders can keep it alive<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TECHNICAL INFO<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine:<\/strong> Unreal Engine 5.8<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>View:<\/strong> first and third person<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modes:<\/strong> single-player, co-op, online PvP, and dedicated servers you can host yourself<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform:<\/strong> Windows (Steam)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up with nothing.<\/strong> No shoes. No money. No friends. A brick in your hand and a whole city that does not care if you make it to morning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/33f93a44b8ebd178c657646563aa9a4a.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/33f93a44b8ebd178c657646563aa9a4a.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/33f93a44b8ebd178c657646563aa9a4a.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRICK 2: Rags 2 Riches<\/strong> is an open-world survival game about starting at the very bottom of Brick City and taking your way to the top. Food, water, a roof, a gun, a car, a crew, a name people know: you take it, make it or steal it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it alone, with friends in co-op, or on online PvP servers that keep running when you log off. Every base you can see is one you can raid, and every one you build has to hold while you are gone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In BRICK 2 today:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge island: Brick City's towers and blocks, the suburbs, highways, forest, lakes, a frozen highland, dust flats and the sea<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP and co-op on dedicated servers, with a server browser and voice chat for everyone nearby, your crew or your party<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty AI rivals playing the same game you are: they gather, build bases, form crews, take turf, raid each other and talk in chat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rust-style base building: foundations, walls, doors, stairs, gates and ladders, upgraded from wood to stone to metal, with code locks, tool cabinets and upkeep<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power, turrets and traps: generators, cables, lights, spikes, barbed wire, landmines and bear traps<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real ballistics: bullet drop, iron sights, scopes and attachments, from pipe pistols to sniper rifles, crossbows, rocket launchers and C4<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanted stars, police waves, SWAT, and a police helicopter you can bring down<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heists and dangerous places: Summit Bank, the military airbase, the prison, the Old Mine and the Abandoned Metro<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars to steal off the street or buy at Big Tony's, to wreck and repair; buses, taxis and a train around the city<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting, fishing, farming, cooking and crafting, with gear that rolls a rarity from common to legendary<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hustling on corners, pawn shops, a gun store, a phone full of contacts with jobs, quests, eighteen skills and 41 Steam achievements<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint pictures for your walls, spray graffiti tags, and play real games on the arcade cabinets<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up with nothing.<\/strong> No shoes. No money. No friends. A brick in your hand and a whole city that does not care if you make it to morning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/33f93a44b8ebd178c657646563aa9a4a.poster.avif?t=1793722360\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/33f93a44b8ebd178c657646563aa9a4a.webm?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/extras\/33f93a44b8ebd178c657646563aa9a4a.mp4?t=1793722360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRICK 2: Rags 2 Riches<\/strong> is an open-world survival game about starting at the very bottom of Brick City and taking your way to the top. Food, water, a roof, a gun, a car, a crew, a name people know: you take it, make it or steal it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it alone, with friends in co-op, or on online PvP servers that keep running when you log off. Every base you can see is one you can raid, and every one you build has to hold while you are gone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In BRICK 2 today:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge island: Brick City's towers and blocks, the suburbs, highways, forest, lakes, a frozen highland, dust flats and the sea<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP and co-op on dedicated servers, with a server browser and voice chat for everyone nearby, your crew or your party<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty AI rivals playing the same game you are: they gather, build bases, form crews, take turf, raid each other and talk in chat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rust-style base building: foundations, walls, doors, stairs, gates and ladders, upgraded from wood to stone to metal, with code locks, tool cabinets and upkeep<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power, turrets and traps: generators, cables, lights, spikes, barbed wire, landmines and bear traps<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real ballistics: bullet drop, iron sights, scopes and attachments, from pipe pistols to sniper rifles, crossbows, rocket launchers and C4<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanted stars, police waves, SWAT, and a police helicopter you can bring down<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heists and dangerous places: Summit Bank, the military airbase, the prison, the Old Mine and the Abandoned Metro<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars to steal off the street or buy at Big Tony's, to wreck and repair; buses, taxis and a train around the city<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting, fishing, farming, cooking and crafting, with gear that rolls a rarity from common to legendary<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hustling on corners, pawn shops, a gun store, a phone full of contacts with jobs, quests, eighteen skills and 41 Steam achievements<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint pictures for your walls, spray graffiti tags, and play real games on the arcade cabinets<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"You start with a brick. Everything else you take, make or steal. Build a base, run a crew and raid other players in online PvP, on an island of gangs, police and SWAT shared with twenty AI survivors who build, form clans and raid whether you turn up or not.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/6cce0f70e622df35fafa8dc1ccf63ffc79fb61c5\/header.jpg?t=1793722360","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/0b392a81f54bfc7851a908125070a0f5cf6eb369\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793722360","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4098920\/0b392a81f54bfc7851a908125070a0f5cf6eb369\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793722360","website":"https:\/\/brick-2.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 3.0 GHz or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 8 GB<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 25 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD required. DirectX 12 GPU with Shader Model 6 support.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 6-core 3.5 GHz+<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 32 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> RTX 4070 or AMD RX 7800 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 30 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD required. DirectX 12 GPU with Shader Model 6 support.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["UndaWirrld Arcade"],"publishers":["UndaWirrld Arcade"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":489,"final":293,"discount_percent":40,"initial_formatted":"4,89€","final_formatted":"2,93€"},"packages":[1436497],"package_groups":[{"name":"default"